      "status": "mathematical proof reconstructed",
      "correspondence": "Contractive iteration in R[[T]] constructs w_W(T)=T³w_U(T), and monomial divided differences form λ(U₁,U₂) and u₃ without division. Differentiating the secant cubic along f_w(U_i)∂_{U_i} proves ω_W(F_W)∂_{U_i}F_W=ω_W(U_i), yielding log_W(F_W(U₁,U₂))=log_W(U₁)+log_W(U₂) over characteristic-zero fields and transferring the commutative formal group axioms from Z=ℤ[A₁,A₂,A₃,A₄,A₆]⊂Frac(Z) to every commutative ring R.",
      "review": "Verified contractive degree shift on TR[[T]], division-free secant factorization, invariant-derivation cancellation of c₃(u₃−U₁)(u₃−U₂), sign reversal under i_W, and short-model normalization −x(z)/y(z)=z+O(z⁵)."
    },
